  "content": "<h3><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QZUJtsbkcY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Присоединяйтесь к Discord, чтобы общаться со мной и другими участниками о Minecraft</a></h3>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kD11hZu.png\" alt=\"\"> ОБЗОР <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kD11hZu.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p>Альтернативные варианты детёнышей мобов для <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft</a></p>\n<h4>Примечания:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Требуется <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/data-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Data API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A8bTUqW.png\" alt=\"\"> ОСОБЕННОСТИ <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A8bTUqW.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Посетите <a href=\"https://github.com/GenMode/Minecraft/wiki/Better-Babies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">вики</a> для получения дополнительной информации</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Сущности:</h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fCat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tu7LUf0.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fChicken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TUVzIXb.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fCow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mdzM4fO.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fFox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RvTf0k0.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMooshroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wgm1Tip.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fPig\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"no